{{- define "branch-integration-context" -}}
{{- if eq .IntegrationPhase "slice"}}

=== SLICE INTEGRATION CONTEXT ===
SOURCE COMMIT: {{.IntegrationSourceCommit}}
ORIGINATING PLAN: {{.IntegrationOriginatingPlan.ID}} — {{.IntegrationOriginatingPlan.Description}}
Shared intent: {{.IntegrationOriginatingPlan.DoneWhen}}
Spec: {{.IntegrationOriginatingPlan.SpecRef}}
Plan: {{.IntegrationOriginatingPlan.PlanRef}}
Architecture: {{.IntegrationOriginatingPlan.ArchRef}}

ROOT LINEAGES:
{{- range .IntegrationRootTaskIDs}}
- {{.}}
{{- end}}

ATTRIBUTED DESCENDANTS:
{{- range .IntegrationDescendants}}
- {{.ID}} @ {{.Commit}}: {{.Description}}
  Acceptance criteria: {{.DoneWhen}}
  Spec: {{.SpecRef}}
{{- if .DependsOn}}
  Dependencies: {{range $index, $dependency := .DependsOn}}{{if $index}}, {{end}}{{$dependency}}{{end}}
{{- end}}
{{- with .Decomposition}}
{{- if .OwnedFiles}}
  Owned files: {{range $index, $value := .OwnedFiles}}{{if $index}}, {{end}}{{$value}}{{end}}
{{- end}}
{{- if .OwnedModules}}
  Owned modules: {{range $index, $value := .OwnedModules}}{{if $index}}, {{end}}{{$value}}{{end}}
{{- end}}
{{- if .ReadOnlyDependsOn}}
  Read-only output dependencies: {{range $index, $value := .ReadOnlyDependsOn}}{{if $index}}, {{end}}{{$value}}{{end}}
{{- end}}
{{- if .ReadOnlyTaskDependsOn}}
  Read-only task dependencies: {{range $index, $value := .ReadOnlyTaskDependsOn}}{{if $index}}, {{end}}{{$value}}{{end}}
{{- end}}
{{- if .InterfacesOwned}}
  Interfaces owned: {{range $index, $value := .InterfacesOwned}}{{if $index}}, {{end}}{{$value}}{{end}}
{{- end}}
{{- if .InterfacesConsumed}}
  Interfaces consumed: {{range $index, $value := .InterfacesConsumed}}{{if $index}}, {{end}}{{$value}}{{end}}
{{- end}}
{{- if .CoverageNotes}}
  Coverage notes: {{.CoverageNotes}}
{{- end}}
{{- end}}
{{- end}}

ATTRIBUTED PATHS:
{{- range .IntegrationAffectedPaths}}
- {{.}}
{{- end}}
{{- if not .IntegrationAffectedPaths}}
(none)
{{- end}}

IMMUTABLE SNAPSHOT READS:
{{- range .IntegrationSnapshotPaths}}
git -C {{$.ShellIntegrationWorktree}} show {{$.ShellIntegrationSnapshot .}}
{{- end}}
{{- if not .IntegrationSnapshotPaths}}
(no affected path exists at the source commit)
{{- end}}

Review only intra-plan composition and the shared intent above. Later sibling changes and goal-wide concerns are outside this slice boundary.
Run the smallest tests covering the attributed descendants, paths, declared validation, or plausible composition risks from {{.Worktree}}.
{{- else if eq .IntegrationPhase "global"}}

=== GLOBAL INTEGRATION CONTEXT ===
GENERATION: {{.IntegrationGeneration}}
SOURCE COMMIT: {{.IntegrationSourceCommit}}

COVERAGE MAP (navigation evidence, not proof of aggregate correctness):
{{- range .IntegrationCoverage}}
- {{.PlanTaskID}} [{{.Kind}}]
{{- range .ApprovalAttestations}}
  - reviewed task {{.ReviewedTaskID}} @ {{.ReviewedCommit}}; merge {{.MergeCommit}}; approver {{.Approver}}
    Acceptance criteria: {{.AcceptanceCriteria}}
{{- if .Validation}}
    Validation: {{range $index, $command := .Validation}}{{if $index}}; {{end}}{{$command}}{{end}}
{{- end}}
{{- end}}
{{- with .SliceReport}}
  - slice analysis {{.AnalysisTaskID}} ({{.AnalysisKey}}): {{.Verdict}}; source {{.SourceCommit}}; report {{.ReportCommit}}
{{- end}}
{{- end}}
{{- if not .IntegrationCoverage}}
(no local coverage records; fewer than two contributing scopes bypass local coverage)
{{- end}}

GOAL CONTRIBUTION (reviewed task ranges; commits that reached the integration branch through other work are excluded):
{{- range .IntegrationPlanSurfaces}}
- {{.PlanTaskID}} (tasks {{len .Tasks}}, paths {{.PathCount}})
{{- range .Tasks}}
  - {{.ID}} @ {{.BaseCommit}}..{{.ReviewCommit}} (paths {{.PathCount}}){{with .Description}}: {{.}}{{end}}
{{- end}}
{{- if .InterfacesOwned}}
  Interfaces owned: {{range $index, $value := .InterfacesOwned}}{{if $index}}, {{end}}{{$value}}{{end}}
{{- end}}
{{- if .InterfacesConsumed}}
  Interfaces consumed: {{range $index, $value := .InterfacesConsumed}}{{if $index}}, {{end}}{{$value}}{{end}}
{{- end}}
{{- end}}
{{- if .IntegrationPriorRepairs}}

PRIOR GLOBAL REPAIRS (navigation and suite diagnosis; not seams by themselves):
{{- range .IntegrationPriorRepairs}}
- {{.ID}} @ {{.BaseCommit}}..{{.ReviewCommit}} (paths {{.PathCount}}){{with .Description}}: {{.}}{{end}}
{{- end}}
{{- end}}

CROSS-PLAN SEAMS:
{{- if or .IntegrationSeamPaths .IntegrationSeamInterfaces}}
{{- range .IntegrationSeamPaths}}
- path {{.Name}}: {{range $index, $value := .PlanTaskIDs}}{{if $index}}, {{end}}{{$value}}{{end}}
{{- end}}
{{- range .IntegrationSeamInterfaces}}
- interface {{.Name}}: {{range $index, $value := .PlanTaskIDs}}{{if $index}}, {{end}}{{$value}}{{end}}
{{- end}}
{{- else}}
(no cross-plan seam: no path or declared interface is shared by two plans; only suites at HEAD apply)
{{- end}}

SEAM REVIEW:
Check only whether the plans agree at each seam above (shared path, interface, data contract, shared resource) at the source commit. Plan-internal code is out of scope: task code review and slice analysis already covered it; do not audit it.
git -C {{.ShellIntegrationWorktree}} show {{.ShellIntegrationSnapshot "<path>"}}
git -C {{.ShellIntegrationWorktree}} diff <base>..<review> -- <path>
git -C {{.ShellIntegrationWorktree}} diff --name-only <base>..<review>

SUITES AT HEAD:
Run the project's declared test, lint, and type-check suites once from {{.Worktree}} over the whole branch: a merge from other work can break goal code.
A failure is a finding when it breaks code or tests this goal changed (listed above), seam or not; the fix targets goal-owned code.
Defects confined to code this goal did not change are observations in your report, never fix tasks.
{{- else if ne .GoalBaseCommit ""}}

=== BRANCH INTEGRATION CONTEXT ===
SCAN BOUNDARY: goal base commit {{.GoalBaseCommit}}

DIFF COMMANDS (execute in your worktree to map changes for this goal):
git -C {{.Worktree}} diff --name-only {{.GoalBaseCommit}}..HEAD
git -C {{.Worktree}} diff --stat {{.GoalBaseCommit}}..HEAD
If you need detail, inspect only targeted paths from the map:
git -C {{.Worktree}} diff {{.GoalBaseCommit}}..HEAD -- <path>

VALIDATION (after changed-file and diff inspection):
Run the smallest tests covering changed files, declared validation, or plausible integration risks from {{.Worktree}} without `cd &&`; use runner directory flags or the execution tool's working directory.
For broad/noisy suites, report only command, exit code, failing names/counts, first relevant error, and new-vs-baseline status.
Treat failures as findings only when tied to this diff, new versus baseline, or baseline unknown and documented as an evidence gap.

COMPLETED TASKS:
{{- range .CompletedTasks}}
- {{.ID}}: {{.Description}}
  Spec: {{.SpecRef}}
{{- end}}
{{- if not .CompletedTasks}}
(no completed tasks found)
{{- end}}
{{- end}}
{{- end -}}
